A page's top-level frames are its slides, in layer order. TeleDesign's
Slides panel lists them (telecode_slides_list), reorders them by drag
(telecode_slides_reorder, one undo step; the slides keep the child slots
they occupied, and arrange=true lines them up left to right so the canvas
reads in slide order), and presents / exports them to PDF through the
regular export_image and export_pdf tools.
